        {
          "text": "main initializes start_time and timed_blocks, then resets both on reaching model.first_block_idx. In the inspected Llama layout, this boundary follows the embedding and precedes transformer blocks, excluding model setup, calibration preparation and embedding processing from the running estimate.",
